    "title": "INVITATION TO BID CONSULTANCY FOR MARKET SYSTEMS DEVELOPMENT (MSD) RESEARCH IN SOUTH OMO, BORENA, TIGRAY AND ADDIS ABABA: CHALLENGES AND OPPORTUNITIES FOR INCLUSIVE LIVELIHOODS",
